{"uid":"6c281f232e8f8c32","name":"test_huge_output_line_does_not_kill_job","fullName":"tests.test_e2e#test_huge_output_line_does_not_kill_job","historyId":"8c7a77dd381f0848aba2aae46f56afd2","time":{"start":1791921665547,"stop":1791921666664,"duration":1117},"description":"pi emits full message snapshots per NDJSON event; a single line can be\n    hundreds of KiB. Regression: this used to raise 'Separator is not found'\n    and fail the entire job instead of at most one iteration.\n\n    Task 002 (A.6, #216/#217): this body makes exactly one `engine_factory()`\n    call, so exactly one engine starts over the run dir it uses -- there is\n    no second, overlapping engine here to name. `tests/conftest.py`'s\n    `LiveRun` derives the registry-less run dir from `tmp_path` alone, not\n    from `run_id` (`self.run_dir = tmp / \"run\"`), so every `LiveRun` this\n    ONE test's body constructs would land on the same path -- that is the\n    latent collision this class of test can hit, but only across multiple\n    `engine_factory()` calls inside one test body, which this test does not\n    make. No barrier is added here: there is nothing to serialize against.\n    ","descriptionHtml":"<p>pi emits full message snapshots per NDJSON event; a single line can be<br />\nhundreds of KiB. Regression: this used to raise 'Separator is not found'<br />\nand fail the entire job instead of at most one iteration.</p>\n<pre><code>Task 002 (A.6, #216/#217): this body makes exactly one `engine_factory()`\ncall, so exactly one engine starts over the run dir it uses -- there is\nno second, overlapping engine here to name. `tests/conftest.py`'s\n`LiveRun` derives the registry-less run dir from `tmp_path` alone, not\nfrom `run_id` (`self.run_dir = tmp / &quot;run&quot;`), so every `LiveRun` this\nONE test's body constructs would land on the same path -- that is the\nlatent collision this class of test can hit, but only across multiple\n`engine_factory()` calls inside one test body, which this test does not\nmake. No barrier is added here: there is nothing to serialize against.\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"_isolate_ambient_home_in_process","time":{"start":1791921665540,"stop":1791921665542,"duration":2},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"monkeypatch","time":{"start":1791921665540,"stop":1791921665540,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isolate_ambient_task_record_dir","time":{"start":1791921665542,"stop":1791921665542,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_scrub_notifier_env_in_process","time":{"start":1791921665542,"stop":1791921665544,"duration":2},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_stub_escalation_backoff_at_class_level","time":{"start":1791921665544,"stop":1791921665544,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_stub_wait_out_backoff_at_class_level","time":{"start":1791921665544,"stop":1791921665544,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_undo_instant_sleep_patches","time":{"start":1791921665545,"stop":1791921665545,"dur